      "role": "user",
      "content": "We want one network for the whole cohort showing how both TFs and miRNAs regulate their target genes across our 60 failing-heart samples; we have the expression matrix, a PPI file and a prior that holds TF motifs and miRNA-target predictions. I'm not sure whether anyone in the lab ever made the separate file listing our miRNA IDs that goes with it."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Before I go ahead, could you settle this point you mentioned? Do you have this input?\n  You wrote: \"I'm not sure whether anyone in the lab ever made the separate file listing our miRNA IDs that goes with it\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
